    <tags>axis camera-station-pro acs video surveillance vms client</tags>
    <summary>Client for AXIS Camera Station Pro video management software</summary>
    <description>AXIS Camera Station Pro Client connects to AXIS Camera Station Pro servers to view live and recorded video, and to manage cameras and other devices.

This package installs the client only (no server). It requires 64-bit Windows and .NET Framework 4.8.

**Note:** AXIS Camera Station Pro is the successor of AXIS Camera Station 5 and uses the same Windows Installer upgrade code. Installing this package upgrades an existing AXIS Camera Station 5 client (for example from the `axis-camera-station-client` package) to Pro. The two clients can't be installed side by side.

## Package Parameters
Axis only provides the installer after the Axis license agreement (https://www.axis.com/legal/acs-download) has been accepted. Read it and pass `/AcceptEula` to accept it; without this parameter the installation stops before anything is downloaded.

- `/AcceptEula` - **Required.** Accept the Axis license agreement.

By default the client is installed with firewall rules and a desktop shortcut, telemetry turned off, system TLS settings left alone, and no client launch or autostart.

- `/Telemetry` - Allow Axis to collect usage data (telemetry consent).
- `/DisableTls` - Let the installer turn off TLS 1.0 and 1.1 system-wide. The change takes effect after a reboot.
- `/NoFirewall` - Don't create Windows Firewall rules for the client.
- `/NoDesktopShortcut` - Don't create a desktop shortcut.

Example: `choco install axis-camera-station-pro-client --params "'/AcceptEula /NoDesktopShortcut'"`

The installer language is detected from the system's regional settings.
</description>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency id="netfx-4.8" version="4.8.0" />
    </dependencies>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools/**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
